<p>stats put its timings in the header: <b>{$vStats}</b></p>
<p>track filed the request, on disk and in the database: <b>{$vTrack}</b></p>
<p>xml wrote one level tree for this request: <b>{$vXml}</b></p>
<p>xml wrote the occurrences of a loop inside its element: <b>{$vOccur}</b></p>
<p>xref has the probe on record: <b>{$vXref}</b></p>
